OL,3,GNEWSACathedral aisle shut after ceiling
OL,4,Astone falls
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We can confirm that no individuals
OL,7,Fwere in the immediate vicinity when the
OL,8,Fmasonry fell and no injuries were
OL,9,Fsustained," said Bristol Cathedral.
